  "material.theaurorian.cerulean": "晶蓝",
  "material.theaurorian.cerulean.flavor": "轻盈迅捷的蓝色合金,持于手中几乎感觉不到重量。",
  "material.theaurorian.cerulean.description": "钻石级材料,挖掘速度极快。自带极光之力特性。",
  "material.theaurorian.moonstone": "皎月石",
  "material.theaurorian.moonstone.flavor": "受月光祝福的宝石,在夜空下从不磨损。",
  "material.theaurorian.moonstone.description": "均衡的铁级材料。月光特性可在极光幽境或夜晚免除耐久损耗。",
  "material.theaurorian.auroriansteel": "极光钢",
  "material.theaurorian.auroriansteel.flavor": "由极光之光铸就,是极光王国的骄傲。",
  "material.theaurorian.auroriansteel.description": "强大的钻石级合金,耐久与伤害俱佳。自带极光之力特性。",
  "material.theaurorian.silentwood": "谧木",
  "material.theaurorian.silentwood.flavor": "在寂静中生长的木材,仿佛不受时间侵蚀。",
  "material.theaurorian.silentwood.description": "轻便的木级材料,耐久较低。自带栽培与极光之力特性。",
  "material.theaurorian.aurorianstone": "极光石",
  "material.theaurorian.aurorianstone.flavor": "极光幽境大地的基石。",
  "material.theaurorian.aurorianstone.description": "廉价易得的铁级材料,拥有更多强化槽。自带极光之力特性。",
